  "summaries": [
    {
      "id": 35318,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "Vendor created and managed site desafio5estrelas.com exposes an administrator login password through the javascript source. This site was used by Uber in Portugal to encourage low-rated drivers to raise their ratings.This password allowed remote users access to the administrator panel of the site, which exposed data collected through the in-game surveys, as well as user IDs which can be used to log in as the user within this site.",
